Trigger Zone Script
The first script you need to make is the one for the trigger zone. Remember that the trigger zone
simply destroys any objects that make their way past the player. To create this, simply create a
new script named TriggerZone and attach it to the trigger zone game object. Place the following
code in the script:
void OnTriggerEnter(Collider other)
{
Destroy(other.gameObject);
}
The trigger script is very basic: It just destroys any object that enters it.
